    {
      "id": "73f34ea3-97f0-486c-97c7-28fa8ee3fd1c",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue a estrutura ao julgamento social do grupo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "47b2c10b-b981-40e6-8ea2-9a5eecb7a18c",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora observe uma avaliacao social do comportamento.</p><p><strong>En este grupo está mal visto mirar el móvil mientras alguien habla.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Neste grupo, pega mal olhar o celular enquanto alguém fala.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/427c4476c8214fdd9145c524f310337d_b04-movil-mal-visto.png?Expires=1794099703&Signature=ijEsooF~tETI1keDZ0BN58K85IaWzYngjt3nzzcPOm6~hWXlIYFNC19ufgg1SRhB8mE2BhM6IOJ6xZi4WiiWQQ5DfjfGSuX~nmR4T0Y0fCrBs4Jq2dhEVDxp6m6PgmBYIYxpLTmmoG1KkMctrge9ZuwHnFq~uLQAYDih6VhLAeQwr7pRqn56-wlM1GkRGBRclx~lT69Ulzs19suJ3S7lwY7EmAHEVS07chNvDdhGfQno9TO7ZMcyt7S9fBLZIyjGLD2fg1AiuMVqmXxu1sRueAlT8VE8qUvG~0nHRRdqEX2d-aVZZs7jjOcjzn2esUv-qrsrX35xYYoKQo2WeZGm2w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c5261237e93649dda7d5d0af8a434eb0_b04-en-este-grupo-esta-mal-visto-mirar-el-movil-mientras-alguien-habla.mp3?Expires=1794099703&Signature=Sa9~JwmTCN1uwqN5BxMHu5r~xoyCZO3gDgDeZh8zlfkry1CnQsvg3~jQm8kvh1W9~6cQwx5qUI~rUZL~ysf~fmGWTQ2OSi7GxBkkZHdbIeA7XS3rL9VltAfPsWAWWzyAeSSJ5anH3aszOOOnKhhPkOR2y-q-LR1bWUIPbkcQqwG5VmHc7YGNbYgxrVjqEdKUqShdBHXcBvhiVhMKRgate-BzNZiUbulDItRk9NCXkdcQVBntQS1WBXbjf2UtytRMs5DhGHMLefih7V5rLGCdyBA6f8580UhvvDkeV8oqszam9wu9BAEI8JW-vt-O2Xnklo3awE0Oo6H1-2IQXEpEIA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
